em and we could  promote are indeed here in Africa to  create some of these products to be some  of these entrepreneurs and make this  happen there so create this new system  here and some of the companies  themselves I mean there's plenty of  demand there what what since what's  holding them back from supplying that  demand I mean some of them talk about  they they would like to sell 10x what  they can courage yourself so for many of  these capitals it's that markets don't  price consumer risk very well and  particularly in markets like ours in  emerging markets and here in Africa so  there's not enough working capital  coming into this space because the big  finance here's a look at this space and  they say well I don't know how to price  that risk so I'm gonna stay away from it  and that's really holding a lot of these  companies back well it's incredibly  exciting to picture what what could  happen here I mean in my mind this might  be the biggest leap frog of them all and  thank you for all you're doing and thank  you for sharing that vision  [Applause]

